2100 GOSUB 6320:BM$="Clark: So... Who were those robed creeps, Susanna? They kinda looked like a\bunch of white sorcerers.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
2110 GOSUB 6310:BM$="Susanna: Thank you for saving us. They were northern sorcerers. If it\weren't for your timely intervention, they would have killed us with one of\their curses.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
2120 GOSUB 6320:BM$="Clark: This is some kind of war between northern and dark sorcerers... I bet\my ass that other car we crossed carried more of 'em. Lemme guess: it's all\because of the star of darkness.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
2130 GOSUB 6310:BM$="Susanna: You must be really good detectives if you figured out that much. I\must ask you not to delve any deeper than this if you care for your lives.\Susanna: Don't take this the wrong way: I'm telling you for your own safety.":GOSUB 5100:BM$="I'm really grateful for your help, I mean it.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
2140 GOSUB 6320:BM$="Clark: Then that stuff about David having inherited the blood of the Devil\King's gotta be true... If you're a dark sorceress, I figure our client must\be one of them northern fellas.":GOSUB 5100
2150 BM$="Clark: By the way, that reporter, Connors? After his parents died, he was\raised by the Archbishop of St. Radford's Church in Stratford.":GOSUB 5100
2160 BM$="Clark: I'm Stratfordian born and raised, that's why he looked familiar. He\was an altar boy at the church. His mysterious benefactor could be\Archbishop Mellis.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
2170 GOSUB 6300:BM$="David: Are you guys detectives? How do you know about Susanna?":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
2180 GOSUB 6310:BM$="Susanna: Mr. Clark and his friend have been following us since our tour of\Europe. Their client is most likely a northern tribesman. That's probably\how the King of the North always knew where to find us.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
2190 GOSUB 6300:BM$="David: Why would two detectives at the service of the King of the North\help us?":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
2200 GOSUB 6320:BM$="Clark: Believe it or not, it was a coincidence. We followed you to the stone\circle, but you weren't doing anything weird, so we went back to the hotel\to rest.":GOSUB 5100
2210 BM$="Clark: That's when we saw a car stop in front of the hotel, and three men\got out to talk with Connors, who then got in the car and left with them.":GOSUB 5100
2230 BM$="Clark: It was already dark, and none of you guys were coming back. On a\hunch we came back to the stone circle, and we saw these white robed\weirdos.":GOSUB 5100
2240 BM$="Clark: When I saw you guys trying to run away, I figured they were up to no\good, so I threatened them with my gun.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
2250 GOSUB 6330:BM$="Vince: I'm actually a big fan of yours, so I recognized you right away.\That's why I opened the door and waited in the car. I had no idea they\really wanted to kill you.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
2260 GOSUB 6300:BM$="David: I see... If you hadn't come, the curse of the King of the North would\have killed us for sure. We owe you our lives.":GOSUB 5100
2270 BM$="David: Could you take us to a car rental? They broke my car, and I really\want to get out of here as soon as possible.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
2280 GOSUB 6320:BM$="Clark: It's safer to go to the police. We can be your witnesses.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
2290 GOSUB 6310:BM$="Susanna: The police will force us to stay and hide us somewhere, but the\curse of the King of the North can be cast from a distance, as long as he\knows where we are.":GOSUB 5100
2300 BM$="Susanna: The police will never believe in the existence of sorcery, so they\won't do anything about it. The only way to be safe is to escape the King of\the North's notice.":GOSUB 5100
2310 GOSUB 6320:BM$="Clark: A curse that can kill people sounds like hogwash to me. Everything\about you guys is so weird... Ah, whatever. Let's find a rent-a-car.":GOSUB 5100
2320 BM$="Even though Clark had been researching the Devil King for quite a while,\he was still skeptical about the existence of magic.":GOSUB 5100
2330 W3=0:GOSUB 6110:GOSUB 6320:BM$="Clark's car stopped under the neon sign of a car rental.":GOSUB 5100
2340 BM$="Clark: ...Well, here we are. I don't know much about this sorcery stuff, but\take care of yourselves.":GOSUB 5100
2350 GOSUB 6310:BM$="Susanna: The King of the North will learn what happened soon. Now that\you've helped us, your own lives could be in danger. It would be best if you\left the UK for a while.":GOSUB 5100
2360 GOSUB 6320:BM$="Clark: We're definitely done with this investigation. We'll hide our butts\somewhere if we ever feel threatened. Have a good one.":GOSUB 5100
2370 COMMON FO:GOSUB 6120:GOSUB 9010:BM$="Clark and Vince drove off.":GOSUB 5100:'
2380 GOSUB 6130:GOSUB 6310:BM$="David and Susanna rented a car, and sped off towards London.":GOSUB 5100
